    "text": "1. Confirm work permit `FUSE-7319` is approved.\n2. Confirm `QW-71F` is disconnected from acquisition.\n3. Confirm the Calder Fuse Station shows **Interlock Closed**.\n4. Run `calderctl wafer inspect QW-71F --bank ember-6`.\n5. Continue only if it returns `leases=0 floor=v11.2 target=v12.6`.\n6. WARNING: The next command permanently seals the firmware floor at `v12.6`. The spectrometer can never load firmware below `v12.6`, and a factory reset cannot lower the floor.\n7. Run:\n\n```bash\ncalderctl wafer seal QW-71F --bank ember-6 --floor v12.6 --permit FUSE-7319\n```\n\n8. Run `calderctl wafer attest QW-71F --bank ember-6`.\n9. Confirm that it returns `floor=v12.6 fuse=sealed`.\n\nNote: This procedure advances the anti-rollback floor only on inactive spectrometer `QW-71F`. It does not alter active spectrometer `QW-88K`.",
